<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">La Borinqueña Más Pequeña (Yajaira Sierra Sastre and others)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2012</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the smallest &quot;national&quot; anthem ever written</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">West Side Story (film, Steven Spielberg)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2021</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the revolutionary words sung by the Sharks</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">La Almojábana (Francisco Ramírez)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1860</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the music, if Ramírez wrote it</span></li></ul></section>
